WEBVTT

00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:17.000
Burst Element.

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.542
Wh-What's that?

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:41.000
Due to a drought of spatial
dark power of unknown origin,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.833
our wide-range incineration
projectiles failed to activate.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:47.583
Immediately afterwards,
a large-scale attack by the enemy

00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:49.375
destroyed 90% of the demi-human unit,

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:55.500
70% of the ogre archer unit,
and over 30% of the dark mage unit.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.083
What do you mean, a drought of unknown origin?

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:04.292
That ridiculously massive formal art is what absorbed
every drop of spatial dark power in the ravine!

00:01:04.292 --> 00:01:06.000
But that's impossible.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.042
An art of that scale, not even I...

00:01:09.042 --> 00:01:12.458
So who was responsible?

00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:51.042
"Blood and Life"

00:02:59.917 --> 00:03:03.042
Welcome back. You did well.

00:03:06.042 --> 00:03:07.917
The enemy has retreated.

00:03:07.917 --> 00:03:10.375
You brought us this victory.

00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:15.208
Lady Fanatio, the battle isn't over yet.

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:18.375
We must use healing arts
to consume the sacred power

00:03:18.375 --> 00:03:22.875
that formal art generated
so the enemy can't reuse it.

00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:29.375
After all, their main forces, the dark knights
and the pugilists guild are still untouched.

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:32.375
Everyone who can move,
take the wounded and fall back!

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:36.917
Monk unit, focus on healing the wounded
until all spatial power is depleted!

00:03:36.917 --> 00:03:39.875
And watch for any movement by the enemy!

00:03:39.875 --> 00:03:42.750
I'm going to report to the Knight Commander.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.875
Can I leave things here to you?

00:03:48.958 --> 00:03:52.292
You did well, too, Amayori.

00:03:52.292 --> 00:03:55.750
Go back to your bed and eat your fill.

00:04:03.208 --> 00:04:04.625
Mentor?

00:04:10.042 --> 00:04:11.208
Eldrie!

00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:12.708
You're not injured, are you?

00:04:12.708 --> 00:04:15.958
Right. I haven't sustained any major wounds.

00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:19.667
But I should have perished in battle.

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:21.625
What are you saying?

00:04:21.625 --> 00:04:26.500
Your duty is to lead the guards
until the battle is over.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.875
I failed to carry out my duty.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.458
Not only was my camp breached by the goblins,

00:04:35.458 --> 00:04:38.708
their chief was brought down by Sir Renly.

00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.167
How shameful is that?

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:45.833
I betrayed your expectations of me.

00:04:46.958 --> 00:04:53.708
To think I had presumed to seek her heart...
her love. It's beyond laughable!

00:04:53.708 --> 00:04:57.750
I have no right to call myself your disciple!

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:01.708
You... You did well.

00:05:01.708 --> 00:05:07.375
I, the guard unit, as well as all the people
of the Human Empire need you.

00:05:07.375 --> 00:05:10.208
Why are you being so harsh on yourself?

00:05:10.208 --> 00:05:14.417
Need? For my strength?

00:05:14.417 --> 00:05:16.250
Or...

00:05:33.917 --> 00:05:37.625
Your life must almost be depleted.

00:05:37.625 --> 00:05:40.250
So why are you standing there unarmed?

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.833
I'm the chief of the ogres, Furgr.

00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:45.625
The chief of the ogres?

00:05:45.625 --> 00:05:47.417
A member of the land of
darkness's Council of Ten?

00:05:47.417 --> 00:05:49.292
I saw.

00:05:49.292 --> 00:05:54.208
That light art... it was you who unleashed it.

00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:59.208
That power, that appearance...
it's you, the Priestess of Light.

00:05:59.208 --> 00:06:02.417
If I take you back with me, this war will end.

00:06:02.417 --> 00:06:05.417
The ogres can return to the grasslands.

00:06:05.417 --> 00:06:07.750
What are you talking about?

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:10.667
Priestess of Light? This war will end?

00:06:10.667 --> 00:06:14.042
Curse you! You lowly beast,
how dare you spout such drivel!

00:06:19.792 --> 00:06:21.625
M-Mentor!

00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:23.750
Why?

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.833
I am indeed the Priestess of Light.

00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.792
Tell me, where will you take me?

00:06:29.792 --> 00:06:33.042
Who is it that seeks me?

00:06:33.042 --> 00:06:36.250
Emperor Vecta.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.500
The emperor only wants the Priestess of Light.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.958
He'll grant any wish to the one
who captures and delivers the priestess.

00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:46.542
The ogres will return to the grasslands.

00:06:46.542 --> 00:06:50.792
Raise horses, hunt birds, and live.

00:06:50.792 --> 00:06:53.083
You don't resent me?

00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:56.375
It was I who massacred your people.

00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:59.917
The strong carry a burden
as heavy as they are strong.

00:06:59.917 --> 00:07:03.375
I also shoulder the burden of chief.

00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:06.083
That's why I'm going to capture you,

00:07:06.083 --> 00:07:09.083
and take you with me!

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:40.292
This soul, at least, can fly to the grasslands.

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:50.583
Emperor... Vecta.

00:07:53.042 --> 00:07:57.917
So you're saying the reason your strategy
failed and a thousand dark mages perished

00:07:57.917 --> 00:08:03.750
was because the enemy absorbed and depleted
the spatial dark power before us, is that right?

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.917
Yes!

00:08:05.917 --> 00:08:08.583
That's correct, Your Majesty.

00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:14.667
I wasn't informed that, even with the pontifex
gone, the enemy still had a mage of that caliber.

00:08:14.667 --> 00:08:17.625
Is there no way to replenish that dark power?

00:08:17.625 --> 00:08:19.458
Unfortunately, sir.

00:08:19.458 --> 00:08:23.500
In order to replenish enough spatial
dark power to annihilate the enemy,

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:29.000
we'd need ample amounts of rich land and sunlight,
but both are absent from the battlefield.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.208
I see.

00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:36.833
But from what I see, there's no grass or trees in
this land, and the sun seems to have already set.

00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:42.083
What power source were you going to use
to attempt to cast this large-scale spell?

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:47.792
Well, the blood spilled by both the demi-humans
and enemy soldiers, and their expired lives

00:08:47.792 --> 00:08:51.958
became dark power and had filled the air.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.458
Blood and life, huh?

00:09:05.167 --> 00:09:09.375
Dee Eye Ell. Would 3,000 be sufficient?

00:09:09.375 --> 00:09:10.667
What?

00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:25.667
That would be enough, Your Majesty.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.750
Priestess of Light?

00:09:40.042 --> 00:09:44.833
Yes. I don't recall ever seeing such
a name in any of the history books,

00:09:44.833 --> 00:09:50.625
but there's no doubt that it's what
the enemy commander desires.

00:09:50.625 --> 00:09:54.833
Commander... the Dark God Vecta, huh?

00:09:54.833 --> 00:09:58.625
I find it hard to believe.
A god has been resurrected.

00:09:58.625 --> 00:10:03.583
Little one. Let's assume that Dark God Vecta
has descended to the Dark Territory,

00:10:03.583 --> 00:10:09.583
that he's seeking the Priestess of Light,
and that this priestess is you.

00:10:09.583 --> 00:10:14.458
The question is, how will that affect
the current battle situation?

00:10:14.458 --> 00:10:18.417
There's no question that the five tribes of the
land of darkness are after the Human Empire.

00:10:18.417 --> 00:10:23.125
But if Vecta's target is
the Priestess of Light...

00:10:23.125 --> 00:10:28.917
Uncle. I shall breach the enemy lines alone,
and head to the edge of the Dark Territory.

00:10:28.917 --> 00:10:31.667
If it's the Priestess of Light
that the enemy commander seeks,

00:10:31.667 --> 00:10:35.208
then he'll definitely pursue me
with a considerable force.

00:10:35.208 --> 00:10:37.667
Once enough distance has split them,

00:10:37.667 --> 00:10:41.208
please counterattack and annihilate
the remaining enemy forces.

00:10:41.208 --> 00:10:45.500
Not to mention, the World End's
Altar is in the Dark Territory.

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:50.417
All right. As soon as this transmission ends,
I'm going to return the FLA rate to 1,000.

00:10:50.417 --> 00:10:53.417
So take Alice and head to the World End's Altar!

00:10:53.417 --> 00:10:54.750
What do you mean, head to--

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:58.833
Listen! Once you exit the Eastern Gate,
the Altar's due south--

00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:01.875
If I go there, perhaps...

00:11:03.625 --> 00:11:04.833
Fine, then.

00:11:04.833 --> 00:11:08.083
But you're taking a third
of our troops with you.

00:11:08.083 --> 00:11:09.417
But...

00:11:09.417 --> 00:11:12.292
I can't have you spare a third of your men!

00:11:12.292 --> 00:11:16.667
The enemy still has more
than 30,000 troops left.

00:11:16.667 --> 00:11:21.333
I don't think that many would come
after you if you're the sole decoy.

00:11:21.333 --> 00:11:26.042
Only if a big enough number fled together
would it work to split them up.

00:11:26.042 --> 00:11:28.708
You do have a point, but...

00:11:28.708 --> 00:11:31.583
Also, I have one more condition.

00:11:31.583 --> 00:11:33.000
What's that?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.458
I'll be joining the raid unit.

00:11:40.583 --> 00:11:42.500
"Dark Territory   Orc Tribe's Camp"

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.542
"Dark Territory   Orc Tribe's Camp"
Orc Chief Lilpilin.

00:11:44.875 --> 00:11:51.167
You're to offer 3,000 sacrifices to be
the foundation of the dark mages' attack art.

00:11:51.167 --> 00:11:53.292
Th-That's insane!

00:11:53.292 --> 00:11:56.375
We all came here to fight!

00:11:56.375 --> 00:12:00.083
Not to pay for your failure with our lives!

00:12:00.083 --> 00:12:03.250
This is an imperial order
from the emperor himself.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.167
Chief.

00:12:05.167 --> 00:12:08.917
We have no choice
but to obey the emperor's orders.

00:12:08.917 --> 00:12:09.958
Lenju.

00:12:09.958 --> 00:12:14.958
I and 3,000 of my troops
will gladly give up our lives.

00:12:14.958 --> 00:12:18.833
For the emperor and for our tribe.

00:12:20.167 --> 00:12:21.583
Lil.

00:12:21.583 --> 00:12:23.458
I believe.

00:12:23.458 --> 00:12:28.792
That the souls of not just humans, but of orcs
will be sent to the heavens after they die.

00:12:28.792 --> 00:12:31.833
Let's meet again there someday.

00:12:32.875 --> 00:12:35.042
I'm so sorry, Len.

00:12:35.042 --> 00:12:37.917
Forgive me. I'm so sorry.

00:12:38.875 --> 00:12:45.167
Gather 3,000 of your troops in close formation
100 mels before the ravine within five minutes.

00:12:45.167 --> 00:12:46.708
That is all!

00:13:00.083 --> 00:13:02.042
All right, let's head out!

00:13:14.625 --> 00:13:16.083
Eldrie.

00:13:18.167 --> 00:13:22.917
Our goal as the raid unit is to split the
enemy forces and destroy the individuals.

00:13:22.917 --> 00:13:24.750
After we've passed through the Eastern Gate,

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:29.625
the guard unit, the monk unit and the Supply
Corps are to head south immediately.

00:13:29.625 --> 00:13:33.208
If there's favorable terrain,
deploy the troops and get into position.

00:13:33.208 --> 00:13:36.917
Until then, we four elite knights
will act as a diversion.

00:13:44.792 --> 00:13:46.833
We're going to defend this
location with our lives.

00:13:46.833 --> 00:13:49.000
Everyone, return to your positions!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.292
System Call.

00:14:06.292 --> 00:14:10.750
Transfer Human Unit Durability. Area to Self.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.875
Generate Umbral Element.

00:14:12.875 --> 00:14:15.958
Form Element, Worm Shape.

00:14:31.958 --> 00:14:37.125
Long live the orcs! Glory to the orcs!

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.250
Lenju!

00:15:00.333 --> 00:15:03.917
Damned humans... damned humans!

00:15:06.792 --> 00:15:10.500
Curse those damned humans!

00:15:19.333 --> 00:15:23.000
This sound... is it group chanting
of a formal art?

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:29.250
Impossible! There's not enough sacred power
left in this area to cast a large-scale formal art!

00:15:30.208 --> 00:15:32.792
Those bastards! What have they done?

00:15:38.333 --> 00:15:41.250
What power!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.792
Ah, how magnificent!

00:15:43.792 --> 00:15:47.583
This devastating spatial dark power.

00:15:52.708 --> 00:15:56.792
Madam Chancellor, there are Integrity
Knights approaching ahead.

00:15:56.792 --> 00:16:01.167
This deathworm curse attack
can't be blocked by swords or armor.

00:16:01.167 --> 00:16:05.542
You damned Integrity Knights...
you'll see what we can do!

00:16:05.542 --> 00:16:09.417
Don't rush! Let them get close enough!

00:16:09.417 --> 00:16:12.208
Not yet.

00:16:14.542 --> 00:16:16.708
Now! Fire!

00:16:20.417 --> 00:16:22.708
Get close and lure them this way!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.333
Pull up!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:32.750
No...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.500
Little one!
It won't work! Not that move!

00:16:42.167 --> 00:16:43.292
Eldrie?

00:16:43.292 --> 00:16:44.667
Go!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.917
No! Eldrie!

00:16:50.917 --> 00:16:54.750
Divine serpent of ancient times!
If you claim to be the king of the snakes,

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:59.250
then let's see you devour that horde
of mere worms completely!

00:17:03.375 --> 00:17:05.917
Release Recollection!

00:17:14.042 --> 00:17:16.958
This way! You vile insects!

00:17:58.625 --> 00:18:02.875
Not yet! I can't fall just yet!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.292
Lady Alice...

00:18:17.875 --> 00:18:20.542
Eldrie!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:41.875
Eldrie!

00:18:52.708 --> 00:18:56.875
Eldrie! Your eyes... open your eyes!

00:18:56.875 --> 00:19:01.250
I won't allow it!
You're not going to leave me like this!

00:19:02.667 --> 00:19:05.667
Mentor... are you safe?

00:19:05.667 --> 00:19:10.250
Yes. Yes, I am safe, thanks to you!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:14.417
Didn't I tell you that I needed you?

00:19:14.417 --> 00:19:22.375
Lady Alice, there are more...
far more people who need you.

00:19:22.375 --> 00:19:30.458
I was such a selfish person...
to think I could keep you all to myself.

00:19:30.458 --> 00:19:34.583
I'll give you whatever you wish for!
So come back!

00:19:34.583 --> 00:19:36.750
You're my disciple, aren't you?

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:40.375
I already have more than enough.

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:45.000
Eldrie! Eldrie!

00:19:48.792 --> 00:19:51.792
Don't cry...

00:19:53.375 --> 00:19:57.083
Mo... ther.

00:20:19.083 --> 00:20:20.750
Eldrie.

00:20:27.167 --> 00:20:33.000
After all the havoc you've wreaked...
don't think you're not going to pay!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.625
Amayori. Takiguri.

00:20:35.625 --> 00:20:37.583
Charge at full speed.

00:20:43.083 --> 00:20:45.042
It can't be! Impossible!

00:20:45.042 --> 00:20:47.125
To extinguish the deathworm curse,

00:20:47.125 --> 00:20:52.042
whose priority level should allow it to devour
the Integrity Knights and the ground troops...

00:20:52.042 --> 00:20:55.417
Just what kind of art did they use?

00:20:58.083 --> 00:21:00.750
Retreat! All hands, retreat!

00:21:02.375 --> 00:21:04.667
You're not getting away! Fire!

00:21:15.167 --> 00:21:17.833
Enhance Armament!

00:21:26.917 --> 00:21:30.750
Shit! Damn! I'm not going to die!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.667
Not in a place like this!

00:21:32.667 --> 00:21:36.500
I'm going to be empress of the world!

00:21:39.042 --> 00:21:40.458
L-Lady Dee!

00:21:40.458 --> 00:21:44.250
What are you-- P-Please stop...

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.875
System Call!

00:21:52.208 --> 00:21:57.583
My name is Alice!
Integrity Knight Alice Synthesis Thirty!

00:21:57.583 --> 00:22:02.500
Proxy of the three gods who protect the
Human Empire, the Priestess of Light!

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:06.583
All those who stand before me,
brace for my holy authority

00:22:06.583 --> 00:22:09.250
to vanquish every last one of you!

00:22:11.375 --> 00:22:13.417
Alice.

00:22:15.208 --> 00:22:17.375
Alicia.

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:52.107
Next time: "Sword and Fist."
